  "priorExpiration": "2009-07-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 521.08 Payment of Fines.\n\n(a) Fines may be paid in person. If a fine is paid in person it shall be made at:\n\nDepartment of Safety\n\nDivision of Motor Vehicles\n\nBureau of Registration\n\n23 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH.\n\n(b) Fines may be paid by mail. If a fine is paid by mail, it shall be mailed to:\n\nDepartment of Safety\n\nDivision of Motor Vehicles\n\nBureau of Registration\n\n23 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH 03305.\n\n(c) Fines may be paid in cash if made in person, or personal check, cashier's check, or money order in person or by mail.\n\n(d) For the purposes of (c), checks shall be made payable to \"NH Department of Safety\".\n\n(e) A protested check shall be pursued as specified in Saf-C 211.\n\nSource. #8544, eff 1-20-06; ss by #9372, INTERIM, eff 1-26-09, EXPIRES: 7-27-09; ss by #9487, eff 6-23-09; ss by #12426, eff 11-30-17 (formerly Saf-C 217.08) (See Revision Note at part heading for Saf-C 522); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 522.08)",
